{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/107540","id":2592730797,"node_id":"PR_kwDOAO6SJc6aie6t","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/107540","diff_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/107540.diff","patch_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/107540.patch","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/107540","commits_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/107540/commits","review_comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/107540/comments","review_comment_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/comments{/number}","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/107540/comments","statuses_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/statuses/76a7c31a5d8121df498d687b1779d750f27833bb","number":107540,"state":"closed","locked":false,"title":"Rename TreeItem's `alt_text` to `description` for consistency with Accessibility API","user":{"login":"Mickeon","id":66727710,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjY2NzI3NzEw","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/66727710?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Mickeon","html_url":"https://github.com/Mickeon","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Mickeon/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Mickeon/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Mickeon/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Mickeon/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Mickeon/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Mickeon/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Mickeon/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Mickeon/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Mickeon/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"body":"So, basically, https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/76829 introduced many accessibility methods and properties across many classes, in order to assign a custom summary for assistive applications. Most commonly, this is referred to as \"_description_\":\r\n- **Control**: `accessibility_description`\r\n- **DisplayServer**: `accessibility_update_set_description` & similar.\r\n- **InputMap**: `get_action_description`\r\n- **Viewport**: `gui_get_drag_description` & `gui_set_drag_description`\r\n\r\nIn comparison, **TreeItem** is the only one that refers to the same concept as \"alternative text\" [^1]: \r\n`set_alt_text`, `get_alt_text`, `set_button_alt_text`. This is inconsistent, and this PR addresses that.\r\n\r\nNote that this breaks compatibility, but only with existing dev versions, as https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/76829 was merged during `4.5`'s development.\r\n\r\n[^1]: **RichTextLabel** actually has an `alt_text` parameter for images, which is entirely appropriate.","labels":[{"id":73330066,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWw3MzMzMDA2Ng==","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/enhancement","name":"enhancement","description":"","color":"aaccff","default":true,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":283518733,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwyODM1MTg3MzM=","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/usability","name":"usability","description":"","color":"447744","default":false,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":955079684,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWw5NTUwNzk2ODQ=","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/breaks%20compat","name":"breaks compat","description":"","color":"b64245","default":false,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":1732720779,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwxNzMyNzIwNzc5","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/topic:gui","name":"topic:gui","description":"","color":"ffee88","default":false,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null}],"milestone":{"id":12070367,"node_id":"MI_kwDOAO6SJc4AuC3f","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godot